| Rank | Attraction | Highlights | Family‑Friendly Features | Price (per adult) |
|------|------------|------------|--------------------------|-------------------|
| 1 | **Oxford Time Tours** | Guided walking tour of historic Oxford, covering colleges, the Bodleian Library, and the Radcliffe Camera. | 2‑hour tour, stroller‑friendly, interactive storytelling for kids. | £30 |
